extends layout

block content
  .row.banner
    .col-12
      h1= title
  .row
    .col-12.col-lg-8
      p Introduction: <br><br>
        p Components: Introduce Team/Self, Background, Demo, To be completed/timeline
      ul
        li| A Rating of 1 - Missing more than two components or components are confusing . <br><br>
        li| A Rating of 2 - Missing two components or components are unclear. <br><br>
        li| A Rating of 3 - Missing one component or components are slighty unclear. <br><br> 
        li| A Rating of 4 - All components present, presented clearly.
          <br><br>
      p Organization of Content: <br><br>
      ul
        li| A Rating of 1 - Listener cannot determine a logical sequence to presentation.  <br><br>
        li| A Rating of 2 - Listener follows the logical sequence of some parts of the presentation. <br><br>
        li| A Rating of 3 - Listener follows the logical sequence of most parts of the presentation. <br><br> 
        li| A Rating of 4 - Listener follows the logical sequence of all of the presentation.<br><br>
      p Time Frame: <br><br>
      ul
        li| A Rating of 1 - Presentation is more than 3 minutes outside of prescribed time(shorter or longer). <br><br>
        li| A Rating of 2 - Presentation is more than 2 minutes outside the prescribed time. <br><br>
        li| A Rating of 3 - Presentation is more than 1 minute outside the prescribed time. <br><br> 
        li| A Rating of 4 - Presentation is within the 30 seconds of the prescribed time. <br><br>
      p Visual Aid: <br><br>
      ul
        li| A Rating of 1 - Visual aids are not at all helpful. They may distract the listener and may be hard to read. <br><br>
        li| A Rating of 2 - Visual aids are OK but do not enhance the presentation. <br><br>
        li| A Rating of 3 - Visual aids are clearly described, but are not particularly engaging. <br><br> 
        li| A Rating of 4 - Visual aids enhance the presentation, are clearly described, and are engaging. <br><br>
      p Knowledge and Preparation: <br><br>
      ul
        li| A Rating of 1 - Speaker is not well prepared and shows inability to answer questions. <br><br>
        li| A Rating of 2 - Speaker shows some preparation but isn't able to answer all questions well. <br><br>
        li| A Rating of 3 - Speaker shows preparation and is able to answer most questions. <br><br> 
        li| A Rating of 4 - Speaker demonstrates a thorough understanding of the subject and answers all relevant questions.
        <br><br>
             
             
      .col-12.col-md-12        